@Chai_aur_Redis_HostAddress = http://localhost:5219

### 1. Push Email to Queue (LPUSH)
POST {{Chai_aur_Redis_HostAddress}}/api/emails
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "alex@example.com",
  "subject": "Welcome to Chai aur Redis!",
  "body": "Here is your registration confirmation."
}

###

### 2. Push Another Email to Queue (LPUSH)
POST {{Chai_aur_Redis_HostAddress}}/api/emails
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "sarah@example.com",
  "subject": "Your Order Invoice #4512",
  "body": "Thank you for your order."
}

###

### 3. Check Queue Length (LLEN)
GET {{Chai_aur_Redis_HostAddress}}/api/emails/length
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Peek Pending Emails without Popping (LRANGE)
GET {{Chai_aur_Redis_HostAddress}}/api/emails/peek?count=5
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Pop and Process One Email (RPOP - FIFO)
GET {{Chai_aur_Redis_HostAddress}}/api/emails/process-one
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Clear Email Queue (DEL)
DELETE {{Chai_aur_Redis_HostAddress}}/api/emails
Accept: application/json

###
